        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBHDSD55, Modern Wire HD Soap Dish</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStylish as it is functional, Deltana's HD Soap Dish is perfect for homes with modern decor.  The WBHDSD55 HD Wire Basket measures 5-1/2\" in length and 4-3/8\" wide, making it useful to store anything from hand soap to shampoo, or even books or spices. It easily mounts to the wall and is made out of solid brass. It is available in satin nickel or polished chrome finishes; and it is made with the attention to high quality that is expected of Deltana. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHDS55-specifications.gif?v=1704354599\" width=\"600\" height=\"263\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBHDSD55 5-1/2\" HD Soap Dish Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBHDSD55 Solid Brass Soap Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Shelf Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Shelf Width: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Screw Holes c.c.: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBHDSD55.pdf?v=1704262291\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBHDSD55 5-1/2\" HD Soap Dish Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
